{
 "purpose": "Database schema and migration reference for the three RegLearn plugins.",
 "warnings": [
  "The spaced-repetition and challenge layer stores its state in the learner’s BROWSER (localStorage keys rlcmi_mem_v1, crl_mem_v1, rlaif_mem_v1). It is per-device and CANNOT be migrated. Learners keep it only if the site keeps the same domain. Changing domain resets review schedules and mistake logs. Scores, XP and certificates are unaffected - those are in the database.",
  "Answer keys live server-side only (postmeta _rlcmi_answer / _rlaif_answer, or wp_crl_activities.answer_payload). Never expose these to the browser on the new site, or every score becomes meaningless.",
  "Progress, review schedules and certificates are keyed to the item uid and to serial_no. Preserve both exactly. Re-importing content with new uids disconnects every learner from their history."
 ],
